            "review_title": "Review at Chilli Thai - Hung Vuong Plaza",
            "review_text": "Camper66997452384\n3 contributions\n0\nChili Thai Hung Vuong Plaza\nOct 2025 • Couples\nChili Thái Hùng Vương is a great spot for Thai food lovers in the area. The restaurant has a cozy and modern atmosphere, perfect for casual dining with friends or family. The menu features a variety of authentic Thai dishes like Pad Thai, Tom Yum, and green curry, all bursting with flavor. The ingredients are fresh, and the spice levels can be adjusted to suit your taste. One highlight is their Thai milk tea—refreshing and perfectly sweet. The service is friendly and attentive, and the food is usually served quite fast. Prices are reasonable for the quality offered. Whether you're craving something spicy or just want a tasty meal, Chili Thái Hùng Vương is worth a visit.\nRead more\nWritten October 5, 2025",
